1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,790
If you fell into Jupiter,

2
00:00:01,790 --> 00:00:04,233
you'd never hit the GROUND.

3
00:00:04,270 --> 00:00:06,260
Jupiter has no floor.

4
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:07,640
Just sky...

5
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:09,100
and more sky.

6
00:00:09,126 --> 00:00:10,535
The deeper you fall,

7
00:00:10,535 --> 00:00:12,433
the thicker that sky gets.

8
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:13,630
Like soup...

9
00:00:13,630 --> 00:00:14,826
then syrup...

10
00:00:14,826 --> 00:00:17,420
then a hot, dark ocean.

11
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:19,333
Still no splash.

12
00:00:19,370 --> 00:00:22,017
NASA actually dropped a probe in.

13
00:00:22,017 --> 00:00:25,090
It lasted fifty-eight minutes...

14
00:00:25,090 --> 00:00:26,566
then got crushed.

15
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:27,980
Oh, and deeper down?

16
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:30,728
Some scientists think it might rain...

17
00:00:30,728 --> 00:00:32,249
DIAMONDS.

18
00:00:32,410 --> 00:00:33,780
Still want to jump?

